    "description": "This 3-in-1 futon sofa blends timeless style, premium comfort, and space-saving practicality. Effortlessly switch between daily sofa, relaxed recliner, and flat sleeper bed modes to adapt to all your daily resting needs. Equipped with 3-level adjustable backrest and independent left-right dual-seat angle adjustment for customized lounging experience, the sofa features plush 9.6\" thick cushions that deliver superior long-lasting body support. Upholstered in skin-friendly, wear-resistant 100% polyester wide-rib corduroy fabric with easy maintenance, it is constructed with a robust internal frame and stable solid wood legs. Standing at 7.8\" high solid wood legs, this futon ensures steady load-bearing performance, easy under-sofa cleaning, and simple quick assembly. Available in warm Orange and versatile Beige two color options, it is an ideal multifunctional piece for small apartments, living spaces, home offices and guest rooms.",
